# Decrypted game dumps: ~58 GB of user-owned game data, never commit these.
# Matched on the EP9000- / CUSA- title folder names rather than a fixed path,
# so any dump the launcher or BB_GAME_DIR points at is covered.
/EP[0-9A-Z]*-CUSA[0-9A-Z]*_*/
